28
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:19,760
[SPEAKER_01] Padalo je, nije ostala.

29
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:22,880
[SPEAKER_02] Pada kajska.

30
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:27,600
[SPEAKER_01] Mislim da me fibra počinjevatat, ali ako je to cijena pobjede.

31
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:32,320
[SPEAKER_01] Idemo jučer u Varaždinu, nedilju?

32
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:33,120
[SPEAKER_01] Ne, dilje.

33
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:41,280
[SPEAKER_01] Ako imamo ovaj uvod u Kisni, to je Ajak smije, daleko je ta Evropa i to je u ovom je bitnije.

34
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,800
[SPEAKER_01] Dobit Varaždinu.

35
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:45,680
[SPEAKER_02] Vratiti im za Varaždinu.

36
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,400
[SPEAKER_01] Ajde.

37
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:48,720
