53
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:48,320
[SPEAKER_01] Top.

54
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,640
[SPEAKER_01] Pokisli su gotovi, sad mogu.

55
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,800
[SPEAKER_01] Ovaj, skini majki, sad nije ručeno.

56
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:59,600
[SPEAKER_01] Onda, šta kažete, jeste zadovoljni, momci, s pobjedom?

57
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:00,640
[SPEAKER_01] Da, zadovoljni.

58
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:06,720
[SPEAKER_03] Evo da, vjerojatno ću nešto i ponoviti što sam rekao kao dan, te da ne krenem s ponavljanjem.

59
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:14,400
