93
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:28,320
[SPEAKER_02] Je li čuo sve one situacije, kad ti ko balon odaje iznositi?

94
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:29,600
[SPEAKER_02] Ko je to ušao?

95
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:32,320
[SPEAKER_02] Mislim da je on to.

96
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,680
[SPEAKER_02] Prid kraju utakmice, on ide vodi balon.

97
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,360
