160
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:38,560
[SPEAKER_02] Mari mi je kraj.

161
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:42,880
[SPEAKER_01] Ne treba, ne treba, imamo začiito.

162
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:45,520
[SPEAKER_01] Imamo Vinko, imaš vinkov.

163
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:48,960
[SPEAKER_01] Imamo Vinko, Vinko ima cviki.

164
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:49,200
[SPEAKER_01] Znači, vi koji imate slike?

165
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:50,000
[SPEAKER_01] Mi nemamo.

166
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:52,080
[SPEAKER_01] Ja bez slika, isto ne vidim.

167
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:56,880
[SPEAKER_01] Znači, jedini je ovdje imao slike da ovdje, jedini može čita.

168
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:58,640
[SPEAKER_01] Možda, možda.

169
00:10:59,120 --> 00:10:59,680
